        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSLP316, Dome Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTypically dome door stops are used in commercial buildings such as schools, shopping malls and offices. The door stop's base height is only 3/16\" so they will clear the bottom of most doors. The Low Profile Dome Floor Door Stop comes packaged with mounting hardware. It is made of solid brass and is available in 10 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSLP316-specifications.gif?v=1704354736\" width=\"388\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSLP316 Dome Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/high-profile-dome-floor-door-stop-deltana-dshp916\"><b>High Profile Deltana DSHP916 Dome Style Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSLP316 Dome Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Base Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Height: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Width: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: off-white</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSLP316.pdf?v=1704262154\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSLP316 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
